404.description:
No lobby carries the supplied code (typo, expired, GC'd —
same v1 caveat as `lobbyId` lookup). RFC 7807;
`type` is `https://bliss.example/errors/lobby-not-found`.

403.description:
The caller is not the current owner of this lobby, so may not
relinquish it (ADR-0098 §2, threat model). RFC 7807;
`type` is `https://bliss.example/errors/lobby-relinquish-forbidden`.

404.description:
No lobby exists for the supplied id, or it has been
garbage-collected (ADR-0055 GC; ADR-0098 §4). RFC 7807;
`type` is `https://bliss.example/errors/lobby-not-found`.

403.description:
The caller holds no seat in this lobby, so there is nothing to
leave (ADR-0098 §2, threat model). RFC 7807;
`type` is `https://bliss.example/errors/lobby-membership-forbidden`.

404.description:
No lobby exists for the supplied id, or it has been
garbage-collected (ADR-0055 GC; ADR-0098 §4). RFC 7807;
`type` is `https://bliss.example/errors/lobby-not-found`.

